    "type": "game",
    "name": "Artisan Acre",
    "steam_appid": 3780020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Artisan Acre</i></strong> gives you opportunities to experience the craft of many sections of artisanal food production, through intricate orchestration of tools, time, temperature, yeast, and molds, to transform simple ingredients into extraordinary delicacies, all within your workshop complete with aging cellars and a period shopfront.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780020/extras/3cc94a2c894dc76ffbca0ab6e775f020.avif?t=1755783367\" width=1600 height=533 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cheeses, Wines, Bakery, and Delicacies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will try to pull your hand and lead you through the world of artisanal food production, focusing on <strong>western cuisine</strong>: <strong>cheeses</strong>, <strong>wine</strong>, <strong>boulangerie</strong>, and <strong>charcuteries</strong>. <i>But beyond that, Asian cuisine and cuisine from several cultures are planned too!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Molds and Bacteria</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Molds and bacteria</strong> are crucial in Artisan Acre. Drop a thing, it contracts a mold; You might have to discard it. Or, if handled carefully, you can try to preserve the contamination to create something tasty, like sourdough and cheeses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Temperature is Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fermentation and cooking depend on precise temperature control. Whether on the stove, in the cellar, or exposed to cold wind, you must manipulate temperature for successful production.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Workshop and its Expansion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will start with a workshop, with cellars and shop, where you can personalize its interior as much as you want, and expand them when you are ready to, with new equipment, new furniture, and new room.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Artisan Acre</i></strong> gives you opportunities to experience the craft of many sections of artisanal food production, through intricate orchestration of tools, time, temperature, yeast, and molds, to transform simple ingredients into extraordinary delicacies, all within your workshop complete with aging cellars and a period shopfront.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780020/extras/3cc94a2c894dc76ffbca0ab6e775f020.avif?t=1755783367\" width=1600 height=533 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cheeses, Wines, Bakery, and Delicacies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will try to pull your hand and lead you through the world of artisanal food production, focusing on <strong>western cuisine</strong>: <strong>cheeses</strong>, <strong>wine</strong>, <strong>boulangerie</strong>, and <strong>charcuteries</strong>. <i>But beyond that, Asian cuisine and cuisine from several cultures are planned too!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Molds and Bacteria</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Molds and bacteria</strong> are crucial in Artisan Acre. Drop a thing, it contracts a mold; You might have to discard it. Or, if handled carefully, you can try to preserve the contamination to create something tasty, like sourdough and cheeses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Temperature is Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fermentation and cooking depend on precise temperature control. Whether on the stove, in the cellar, or exposed to cold wind, you must manipulate temperature for successful production.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Workshop and its Expansion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will start with a workshop, with cellars and shop, where you can personalize its interior as much as you want, and expand them when you are ready to, with new equipment, new furniture, and new room.</p>",
    "short_description": "Artisan Culinary Simulation: Master aged cheeses, vintage wines, fresh sourdough bread, and more gourmet delicacies through careful manipulation of temperature, timing, and fermentation using living cultures, all packed within your own atelier and parlor set in the 1920s era.",
